  "title": "Brief Supplications for this World and other worldly desires",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Although they are numerous, I will mention only thirty supplicatory prayers for this-worldly and otherworldly requests:\n\nFirst: Imam al-Sadiq (‘a) is reported to have advised of saying this supplicatory prayer:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلْنِىْۤ اَخْشَاكَ كَاَنِّىْۤ اَرَاكَ وَ اَسْعِدْنِىْ بِتَقْوٰيكَ وَلَاتُشْقِنِىْ بِنَشْطِىْ لِمَعَاصِيْكَ وَ خِرْلِىْ فِىْ قَضَاۤئِكَ وَ بَارِكْ لِىْ فِىْ قَدَرِكَ حَتّٰى لَا اُحِبَّ تَاْخِيْرَمَا عَجَّلْتَ وَلَاتَعْجِيْلَ مَاۤ اَخَّرْتَ وَاجْعَلْ غِنَاىَ فِىْ نَفْسِىْ وَ مَتِّعْنِىْ بِسَمْعِىْ وَ بَصَرِىْ وَ اجْعَلْهُمَا الْوَارِثَيْنِ مِنِّىْ وَانْصُرْنِىْ عَلٰى مَنْ ظَلَمَنِىْ وَاَرِنِىْ فِيْهِ قُدْرَتَكَ يَا رَبِّ وَ اَقِرَّ بِذٰلِكَ عَيْنِىْ\nAALLAAHUMA AJA'ALNIAA AAKHSHAAKA KAAANIAA AARAAKA WA AASA'IDNIAA BITAQWAAYKA WALAATUSHQINIAA BINASHTIAA LIMAA'AASIYKA WA KHIRLIAA FIAA QADAA'IKA WA BAARIK LIAA FIAA QADARIKA HATAAAA LAA AUHIBA TAAKHIYRAMAA A'AJALTA WALAATAA'JIYLA MAA AAKHARTA WAAJA'AL GHINAAAAA FIAA NAFSIAA WA MATIA'NIAA BISAMA'IAA WA BASARIAA WA AJA'ALHUMAA ALWAARITHAYNI MINIAA WAANSURNIAA A'ALAAAA MAN ZALAMANIAA WAAARINIAA FIYHI QUDRATAKA YAA RABI WA AAQIRA BIDHAALIKA A'AYNIAA\nMay Allah accept this supplication."
}
